OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F496A1774202008
OL,1,  Whll Sp0p(`ph``ph0              G11/29
OL,2,Q]Wjjj S5 5jj jij.j
OL,3,Q]Wjjj S#!!""#"""#"!
OL,4,  Wjjj GENGLAND IN THE WEST INDIES
OL,5,F
OL,6,FEngland face more fitness problems as
OL,7,Fthey battle in the third Test against
OL,8,Fthe West Indies in Bridgetown.
OL,10,FSpinnerCJohn EmbureyFopened the bowling
OL,11,Fon the second day but has the virus
OL,12,Fthat has plagued England and had to
OL,13,Freturn to his hotel soon after lunch.
OL,14,F
OL,15,FAll-rounderCIan BothamFmay have cracked
OL,16,Fa bone in his left hand while trying to
OL,17,Fstop a shot off his own bowling on the
OL,18,Ffirst day and will have an X-ray.
OL,20,FHe is also suffering 'flu symptoms.
OL,21,F
OL,23,Q]CFromG22-03-86C/ teletextarchive.com
