OL,2,V55555555CFULL MILITARY FUNERAL
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5CFOR MOB VICTIM
OL,5, Corporal Derek Wood, one of the two
OL,6, soldiers killed by a mob at an IRA
OL,7, funeral in Belfast, is to be buried
OL,8, with full military honours.
OL,10, The Ministry of Defence said his
OL,11, colleague, Cpl David Howes, would have
OL,12, a private funeral in line with his
OL,13, family's wishes.
OL,15, In the Commons yesterday, Ulster
OL,16, Secretary Tom King said the present
OL,17, policy of policing paramilitary
OL,18, funerals in Ulster was under review.
OL,20, There is also to be a full meeting of
OL,21, the Anglo-Irish inter-Governmental
OL,22, conference later this week.
OL,23,F]DFrom 22-03-88 / teletextarchive.com
