OL,2,V55555555CFOWLER TO FACE
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5CTEACHERS' FURY
OL,5, Employment Secretary Norman Fowler will
OL,6, face angry teachers today when he
OL,7, visits an East London school.
OL,9, Mr Fowler wants to see in action the
OL,10, "compact" system which guarantees jobs
OL,11, for children in return for regular
OL,12, school attendance and exam passes.
OL,14, He arranged the private visit to
OL,15, Haggerston Girls' School in Hackney
OL,16, after the Government announced plans
OL,17, for similar schemes in 12 areas.
OL,19, But staff are angry about the way the
OL,20, Inner London Education Authority, which
OL,21, faces the axe, has been excluded from
OL,22, Government publicity about "compact".
OL,23,F]DFrom 22-03-88 / teletextarchive.com
